    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/extras/28cd85a3d6036cf01aa6320806bea82d.poster.avif?t=1750330793\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/extras/28cd85a3d6036cf01aa6320806bea82d.webm?t=1750330793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/extras/28cd85a3d6036cf01aa6320806bea82d.mp4?t=1750330793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>THE GIST</strong></i></u><strong></strong><br>YOYO PUNK is a Rope-Physics battleground. You play as a tough rebellious <strong>yoyo</strong>, swinging, flailing and crushing other yoyo opponents in intense, fast action, PVP combat arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>SMOOTH LIKE BUTTER</strong></i></u><br>After a long time of development, we're extremly proud of YOYO PUNK's intuitive grappling. try it for yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>EASY TO WIN - HARD TO MASTER</strong></i></u><strong></strong><br>The large variety of traverse options allow you to optimize your locomotion, come at your opponnent as fast as you possibly can to\u00a0deliver powerful and accurate momentum-based attacks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/extras/511f59fa34e454cab3c8db534f2ced23.avif?t=1750330793\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/extras/28cd85a3d6036cf01aa6320806bea82d.poster.avif?t=1750330793\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/extras/28cd85a3d6036cf01aa6320806bea82d.webm?t=1750330793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/extras/28cd85a3d6036cf01aa6320806bea82d.mp4?t=1750330793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>THE GIST</strong></i></u><strong></strong><br>YOYO PUNK is a Rope-Physics battleground. You play as a tough rebellious <strong>yoyo</strong>, swinging, flailing and crushing other yoyo opponents in intense, fast action, PVP combat arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>SMOOTH LIKE BUTTER</strong></i></u><br>After a long time of development, we're extremly proud of YOYO PUNK's intuitive grappling. try it for yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>EASY TO WIN - HARD TO MASTER</strong></i></u><strong></strong><br>The large variety of traverse options allow you to optimize your locomotion, come at your opponnent as fast as you possibly can to\u00a0deliver powerful and accurate momentum-based attacks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/extras/511f59fa34e454cab3c8db534f2ced23.avif?t=1750330793\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\ud83e\ude80\ud83d\udca5YOU ARE A YOYO \ud83d\udca5\ud83e\ude80Swing, Fight &amp; Crush your opponents in intense PvP combat arenas in this unique, fast-paced rope-physics fighter.",
